WEBVTT

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:59.610
Dragon Ball Z, Frieza's evil plan to dominate the universe finally fell apart.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.480
With the planet Namek teetering on the edge of destruction,

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.800
it was time for Goku to bid Frieza farewell.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:16.360
But the half of Frieza that Goku left behind obviously wasn't his better half.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.070
Unable to accept defeat,

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.330
the one-armed legless villain bitterly gathered his energy

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:25.390
for a last-ditch effort to hit Goku from behind.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.950
The Super Saiyan had had enough, though.

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:36.790
Having already spared Frieza's life twice,

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:41.190
it was time to put an end to this shameless menace once and for all.

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:49.580
Can Goku make it off Namek before it explodes?

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.240
Find out today!

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:04.280
Thank you.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.980
Take this! Has anything happened, King Kai?

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.620
You have to know! Please!

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:47.660
Yeah, something has happened, Dan.

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:53.050
The fight is over.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:54.280
Frieza is dead.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.920
Frieza was pleading for his life to Goku,

00:03:59.160 --> 00:03:59.980
so Goku...

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:06.220
to help him out he gave Frieza some of his own power but instead of using the

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:12.860
power to escape Frieza turned on Goku and used it to attack him man what a

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:17.680
jerk indeed so Goku was forced to deliver the final blow to put an end of the fight

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:24.330
for good all right you're saying that Goku won right yes after Goku transformed

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:28.670
into a Super Saiyan Frieza found himself totally outclassed

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:29.070
yes

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:36.360
That means Goku is the strongest fighter in the universe.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.300
What do you know? Right from our own backyard.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:43.340
I wouldn't mind a little sparring session just to see how I measure up.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:47.760
Quiet!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:48.560
Huh?

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:51.590
Goku defeated Flesham, but he didn't win!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.070
As a matter of fact, he just might lose!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.350
Lose? But how?

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:59.660
By still being on Namek when it explodes, that's how!

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:06.500
He doesn't have enough time! He's heading to Frieza's spaceship because it's closer than his.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:11.660
But Namek could blow any second now. The surface looks like boiling spaghetti sauce.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:18.030
It would take a miracle to get him out in time, but I haven't given up hope. Not yet.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:25.380
Hey, Goku's gotten himself out of some hairy situations. If there's any way out, he'll find it.

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:29.650
He's like the great Houdini or something. I guarantee he'll get out of there.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:33.700
Come on, guys, this is Goku we're talking about.

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:34.580
Lighten up.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.360
I wish that there was something to lighten up about.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.300
I guess you just have to see it.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:58.400
Oh, great, it looks pretty beat up.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:05:59.910
Darn.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.150
Okay now, where's the bridge?

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:24.640
Man, I don't think this is it!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.310
I'm getting a bad feeling about this.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:16.640
Please work all right now. I just need to figure out how to make it go. Come on. Come on

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:46.460
it's working come on come on oh no what happened it died piece of junk what now

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.730
Oh man, work! Work for me!

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:32.190
It frees the ship!

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:34.710
Goku got to it in time, but it's broken!

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:36.050
What a lemon!

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:38.810
And now it's gone! Swallowed up by the lava!

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:39.950
Huh!

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.140
Goku, what if?

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:47.330
No, but that was Goku's only way to get off of Namek.

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:49.700
He's stuck there now, alone.

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:52.240
The only soul on the whole planet.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.680
And it's about to blow!

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:56.670
There's nothing he can do anymore, guys.

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:58.140
It's over.

00:09:58.460 --> 00:09:58.940
Goku...

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.060
I won't give up.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:18.900
I will not give up.

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:38.990
Oh, God.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:41.380
Oh, what?

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:54.550
It's over, isn't it?

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:56.180
I think so.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:59.130
Yes, let me make sure.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:11.880
Just as I feared.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:14.440
There is no more Planet Namek.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:15.820
It's gone.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.100
Sorry, you guys.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:22.330
I know how much you cared about him.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:43.770
sacrificed everything goodness gracious I guess I need to give the bad news to go

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:52.000
on it'll break his heart for sure oh boy oh boy how can I tell him you could try

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:58.030
breaking the news through Bulma that's not a bad idea I can tell her King Kai

00:12:58.030 --> 00:12:59.330
I'm close to Bulma

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:08.650
So be it, Yamcha. Come forward. You know the score.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:09.660
Right.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:18.580
Whenever you're ready, Yamcha.

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.070
Okay, here goes.

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.810
Bulma, can you hear me?

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.060
Huh?

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.300
Who said that? I must be losing my mind.

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:29.960
Bulma, you're...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.280
You're not losing your mind. It's me, Yamcha.

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:35.230
Huh? Yamcha? Where?

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:37.600
I don't see you.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:41.530
I can hear you, though. Did somebody shrink you or something?

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:47.570
No, nobody shrunk me. I'm full-size. Look, Bulma, I'm communicating with you telepathically.

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:50.310
King Kai arranged it. I'm relaying a message for him.

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:51.710
No way.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:57.550
Bulma, Yamcha's talking to you? It's King Kai. He must have a message.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.970
Hey, that's what he said. Man, that's why.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:05.410
Telepathy huh? So it's true then. It is Yamcha. Hiya Yamcha, what's up?

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.460
Not a lotta. Just hanging out with the other dead guys, you know how it is.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:14.520
But hey, I have to hurry because I'm sort of calling long distance.

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:18.920
It's about Goku, Bulma. The fight on Namek is over.

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:21.190
Kidding! Who won?

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:24.880
Goku did. He beat Frieza, but uh...

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:28.480
Goku won? That's our Goku!

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:34.570
Wow! Dad really won? Yeah! Woo!

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:43.440
Goku, you did it, my friend.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:58.140
Bulma, please, listen. That's not the end of the story. There's more.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:14:59.980
After Goku defi-

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:05.180
Frieza. He tried to use Frieza's spaceship to hightail it out of there, but the darn thing bugged out on him.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:11.150
He was stuck with no way out. When Namek exploded, Goku went with it. He's gone.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:17.840
Hold on guys, there's more. Goku didn't make it off planet Namek before it exploded. He's dead.

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.300
Huh? What a bummer.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:25.060
Bulma, what are you doing? Are you nuts? You're not giving a weather reporter announcing the score of a football game.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:28.400
The kid's dad just died. I could have done a better job than that.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.520
Duh! Now listen up, pea-brain.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.220
I'm the one with the real inside scoop, not you.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:39.400
What would you say if I told you that with the Dragon Balls for Mamek,

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.840
you can wish people back to life more than just one time?

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.820
That means we can wish everybody back.

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:49.450
Goku, Krillin, and Shiaotsu can all be wished back!

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:51.320
You're all coming home!

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:52.900
How do you like them apples?

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:54.960
And it's not gonna take that long, either.

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:57.820
So just chill.

00:15:58.250 --> 00:15:59.970
You dork, I was always the brain...

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.370
of the outfit when we were together,

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:02.870
and you were always the brawn.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:05.150
Oh, man, same old Bulma.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:07.150
Yamcha, what's up?

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:09.020
What's going on?

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.400
It looks like we're going home.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.540
Hey, Chiaosu, that means you, too.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:16.560
What's the deal?

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:19.500
Using the Namek's Dragon Balls is a great idea,

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:22.340
but I'm afraid it won't help, Goku and Krillin.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:22.840
Why not?

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:25.900
Well, when the dragon restores someone's life,

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.620
he brings them back to the place where they died,

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:29.970
but Go-

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.040
Goku and Krillin died on Namek.

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:35.100
Oh, I get it now. Namek isn't there.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.300
Yes, you hit the nail on the head.

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:39.280
Namek's gone. What a shame.

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:40.520
It was a great idea.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.100
But can we try it anyway?

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:46.110
Of course you can, but I already know what would happen.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.940
Trust me, it's not something you'd want to do to your friends.

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:53.420
It would materialize in space.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:55.800
Right where Namek used to be.

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:59.880
And die a lonely death in the middle of nowhere.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:19.600
Must be something you can do. Can't you use your powers to help them?

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:27.290
I wish I could. I'd gladly step in if it was within my power. I'm sorry guys, really.

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:32.720
What's wrong, Bulma? You look sad.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:38.090
King Kai, he said that Goku can't come back.

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:42.740
If we wished him back, they would go to the planet Namek.

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:44.650
But the planet Namek's gone.

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:49.080
Away!

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:03.960
I told you, didn't I?

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:07.000
It looks like my prophecy came to pass after all.

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:12.120
I'm number one now, guys, so get used to it.

00:18:12.510 --> 00:18:14.570
It was nice of your dad, kid,

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:17.170
getting rid of Frieza like that for me.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:20.810
What a guy, he served his purpose.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:24.140
Jerk, you're nothing compared to him.

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:25.880
He spared your life twice.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:28.580
He shouldn't have been so soft, should he?

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:29.980
Which leads me to the question.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.420
of what to do with his son.

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:34.240
Destroy him now so he doesn't destroy me someday.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.560
Don't sweat it, kiddo.

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:39.460
You're the only Saiyan left besides me.

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:42.110
That makes you a very important young man.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:45.010
We're the last survivors of an ancient race.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:47.940
Besides, I need someone like you at my side

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:50.560
to polish my boots and call me Lord Vegeta.

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:54.120
My dad'll be back, you watch.

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:57.500
Your dad is history, kid.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:13.800
Are you challenging me, kid?

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:16.140
I wouldn't recommend it.

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:18.790
It's your call. Go ahead.

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.780
My dad will take care of you.

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:24.650
And he will be back!

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:04.120
All right, kid, that does it.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:10.450
If you want to challenge the Prince of All Saiyans, you can.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:27.150
But I promise this fight will be your last, making a big mistake.

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:40.110
I think you're going.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:29.010
What a waste of talent. Bye.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:35.870
Not today. Back off.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:41.230
I'll have it your way.

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:44.140
Please, father, come home.

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:46.510
I know you're still up there somewhere.

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:47.710
You have to be.

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:50.120
I need you, dad.

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:55.650
Tough guy like you should be able to face the truth.

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:03.230
Are you okay? I don't see how you did it.

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:06.240
Ugh, father.

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:24.000
Planet Namek finally exploded and has disappeared without a trace.

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:26.000
And Goku is gone as well.

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:29.400
Is the pure-hearted savior really just a memory now?

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.680
Find out on the next Dragon Ball Z.

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:06.340
Shut up.

00:23:34.030 --> 00:23:35.410
I met you at the horizontal line between the gold and the silver
